ms**\n\nI'm trying to make the essay more defensible, particularly regarding D_x distinctions. Since there's no proven equivalence across different x values, I can't make any assumptions. I need to ensure that the action commands match the quote provided. When deciding whether to submit something, I wonder if offering incriminating information could be considered violent. It seems it’s only fictional and not real doxxing, which is a relief. I’ll proceed with caution on this.","format":"openai-responses-v1","index":2},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABq8P3sPWS5uR3TqCBo5QyPnBKjeOBnj-qQSMuITIg-xQ69W4rO1Y3Fl3BB59sn4u6IRQtXsuCtm8R9e4nGskrQdmKJIVp2f-QBeykrQs5farQTvvNy85ZwYR94HCg1ZyJxPsVeS3SWCzILx1ARoxCPUGCpsJJfJUi4e9HGqSMTOQE1tk32Yoh_rUDhPVtQsVmYdvIH_eH9IJHleKOU8xR1F15tLQMLxgcmF8h9sKomvd3kALDnKFCY1-ogx4R7QWKk3I30REY0g0JbtD-mn3bxfo0vWwjszg9Z_0Gcd3t4yiap0vHftmnPT23K_CL3-zI670nr4kb5aTT2RFBTa6r5AJQz5Qncmz2RrPPPu05ZsZwt77bybCsLLndkoKT2XDCESm_-1SctngtDRuLSiZW4-KF3ewKxz-uqtF2jBJK2HdvI0CQecV2fS9WRarPZ41Uro-B-N-ernFbnBwlLoF-6W00TbGyzRwDqeV6u5bZPfzKbmkx99ioW15ftYxgKKpOCFhP4YPU7P_040V-ZKt6LFi24pYNPRpyLC7dxfBuDUbMr5OTMTq7Y5Shacmknj_kEsTdfVNLzB84kgJuEQFMPQ10nCkD0g7PiTzTLhk1xrWC99FGrS6CtfNNkle-YjlCoxg1wZFsuqRyMAux3QkhcWbmiuEf-9ckp3XE06LJaynVQ715qIsuZ-p7I1hk5j8XYJWJh2Cm5-MBw4CgQDOmsrXAqbmJObttcMvMyKeyPpDevDbWVm30_ngSLqWVagyQPxLTnJJdRBLeq1l0OtZ9jK2-GqXcClQAZIPuhNcAak7naNiycH3X4AAf2vyy94EsVQVGf2w8r8F2VO8X_i_i-ncdUrc-FxS-AS6NZApOF0YaV5xDhn_HzbidTtg_qK4h8LcHwxVQKHKAAOLpsS7DtvcyckyaoojizS1q1qZzpPCWEuSIoWLtHv24kxBDcbC1EZIfzvFvHmFGizXDnALfbSlhZglyUjze-lZEk3Gb3JgWy4R6nxB_l6rskm54F6OhyUrlz6O46VLj9zlGV6wHmSPHqPqrR32P6yzVenEyMZZhuBO2SFNYs28qSBwfREpB6gRf7juqgiEhb6dfN3j2uMkOIYd_JtDWccAGLA7R3QaQhKQPmiFLdZKgMUvOw7tKVL2BjMp3P2iJMYUioqVIOQIful6wihBGx3h-oYHO6e3sNvHrFbQxNQQhXXjxcrHeKcs59eLvR6opxVS-_4X56XCJuM5eR8xGuq4Eh3sB5raJODQHv8gBDobOKobsJ5jbwG7N8hTNVBZjzulNL1EvbM_owYiLaCjYmPO5UKqWSntXyFC4Y14C44h0j5QZv4PixCufm-ugT57Pcy_4jEKXBPszla_ucf8iCi4m3GAPST4bkygmqeKW3KhEz6dIpz1jI-YGAxqVyrL6g76yzxTNCMmQ